== History ==
2025
* The Lumberjack's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/2/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/2/2025)|February 2025 Update]].
* On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]] made it so that Lumberjack Ghost is immune to [[Earthquake]], [[Void]], [[Poison]], [[Tornado]], [[Goblin Curse]], [[Firecracker/Evolution|Evolved Firecracker]]'s sparks, and [[Tesla/Evolution|Evolved Tesla]]'s pulse. It also fixed an issue with an enemy Evolved Lumberjack's sound effects.
* On 11/2/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (11/2/2025)|maintenance break]] made it so that Lumberjack Ghost's lifetime is no longer affected by [[Rage]].
* On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]] decreased the Rage's duration after leaving the radius to 1 second (from 2 seconds).
* On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] allowed the [[Executioner]] and [[Ram Rider]] to be affected by Rage.
* On 1/4/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/4/2025)|maintenance break]] fixed a bug where [[Electro Wizard]] could nullify Lumberjack's Evolution's death effects. It also fixed a bug where Lumberjack Ghost would deal incorrect damage.
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the cycles required to 2 (from 1), but also increased the Lumberjack Ghost's damage by 33%. The Rage's damage was also decreased by 23%.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Rage's damage by 21%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased the Rage's speed boost to 30% (from 35%).
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Ghost's Tower Damage by 50%

